maxio-phy-dkms (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial DKMS package for the Maxio MAE0621A Gigabit Ethernet PHY
  * Driver source moved out of the vendor-kernel patch
    (003-maxio-phy-driver.patch) into an out-of-tree DKMS module, with
    two module-form fixes: module_exit now also unregisters the PHY
    fixup (no dangling callback after rmmod), and MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE
    uses the "mdio" table type so file2alias actually emits the
    mdio:<id> alias the MDIO core requests (the old "mdio_bus_id" type
    silently generated no alias — harmless when built-in, fatal for
    module autoload)
  * Programs the RJ45 LED mode: LED1 = link 10/100/1000, LED2 = activity

 -- Seeed Studio <techsupport@seeed.cc>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800
